# ---------- Models ----------
# Predictor code (predictor.py, __init__.py, README.md, model_card.json)
# lives in model_store/<name>/ and is tracked. Weight files live in
# model_store/model_weights/<name>/ (moved there by common/model_sync.py's
# sync_model_weights(); see each predictor's MODEL_DIR) and are synced from
# GCS at runtime -- that whole tree is gitignored. hemolysis_predictor_v2
# is excluded from the split entirely (vendored GPL-3.0 CLI tool, not
# synced) and stays wholly gitignored, code included. omegafold_v1 is
# in-progress vendoring (see model_store/omegafold_v1/README.md) -- not
# yet wired into the pipeline; remove this line once it's ready to commit.
model_store/model_weights/
model_store/hemolysis_predictor_v2/
model_store/omegafold_v1/
model_store/__pycache__/
model_store/*/__pycache__/

