# ---------- Reports ----------
*.pdf
# docs/ itself is tracked (project documentation). Generated PDF reports under it
# stay tracked via the negation below, as before.
!docs/**/*.pdf
**/rationale.md
# scripts/ is NOT ignored. It was, unanchored, which matches a directory of that name at ANY
# depth -- so it silently excluded web/scripts/, whose openapi.py CI runs, and that cost a red
# build once already. The directory holds two tracked project scripts and no scratch files; if
# you need somewhere for throwaway work, use a path that is already ignored rather than
# re-adding a rule that reaches further than it looks.

